        "raw": "<p>My quest for the perfect SotM game accessories continues, this time with an attempt to make an improved hp tracker that&#39;s suitable for minions, environment targets, etc. &nbsp;To that end, I&#39;ve added a page to my SotM site with which you can assemble up to 20 slightly-larger-than-quarter-sized hp tracker spinners.</p><p>The numbers on each one goes 1 to 10, so targets with more hp than that will need to use multiple spinners, but they&#39;re small enough so that using multiples shouldn&#39;t be a big deal. &nbsp;I think these might be a better solution than using dice (which is what I&#39;ve always used) because they&#39;re more portable and no matter how many times your cat jumps right in the middle of your game, they won&#39;t lose their count.</p><p>If this sounds like something you could use, take a look: &nbsp;www.spiffworld.com/sotm</p>",
